      "content": "That's a good start. I like the contrast. For the first section, \"Early Human Ingenuity,\" can you expand on that? I want the signage to really capture the spirit of those groups. Maybe use some more descriptive language about their way of life and how they interacted with their environments—make it feel a bit more... soulful or primal?\n\nAnd for the \"Rise of Modern Civilization,\" can you make the language sharper and more focused on the intellectual breakthroughs? I want to emphasize the shift from intuition to logic and systematic reasoning.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
